%[text] %[text:anchor:M_99d2] 1. Wu, Haixu, Huakun Luo, Haowen Wang, Jianmin Wang, and Mingsheng Long. "Transolver: A Fast Transformer Solver for PDEs on General Geometries." arXiv, June 1, 2024. [https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.02366](https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.02366).  \
